Subject: minshade vs minshades clarification
Message-ID: <b7vffPwEJF8.qL47WQqOAQAJ@nichemapr.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/nichemapr/c/b7vffPwEJF8/m/qL47WQqOAQAJ>
